 3 tablespoons of butter, about 40 cents. A cup of milk, a quarter. Salt and pepper and nickel, that's about $3.30 for a pot that feeds 6. 55 cents a bowl. A can of soup at the store is more than that for one bowl, and half of it is water and salt. A bowl at a restaurant, $8 or $9. Thank you.", "words": [{"w": " And", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.16}, {"w": " one", "s": 0.16, "e": 0.38}, {"w": " more", "s": 0.38, "e": 0.7}, {"w": " thing", "s": 0.7, "e": 1.04}, {"w": " people", "s": 1.04, "e": 1.36}, {"w": " ask", "s": 1.36, "e": 1.76}, {"w": " me,", "s": 1.76, "e": 2.3}, {"w": " can", "s": 2.3, "e": 2.38}, {"w": " you", "s": 2.38, "e": 2.54}, {"w": " make", "s": 2.54, "e": 2.82}, {"w": " it", "s": 2.82, "e": 3.02}, {"w": " ahead?", "s": 3.02, "e": 3.84}, {"w": " Yes,", "s": 3.84, "e": 4.46}, {"w": " make", "s": 4.46, "e": 4.82}, {"w": " the", "s": 4.82, "e": 4.96}, {"w": " soup", "s": 4.96, "e": 5.26}, {"w": " up", "s": 5.26, "e": 5.5}, {"w": " to", "s": 5.5, "e": 5.64}, {"w": " the", "s": 5.64, "e": 5.76}, {"w": " point", "s": 5.76, "e": 6.08}, {"w": " before", "s": 6.08, "e": 6.4}, {"w": " the", "s": 6.4, "e": 6.64}, {"w": " milk", "s": 6.64, "e": 6.96}, {"w": " and", "s": 6.96, "e": 7.36}, {"w": " keep", "s": 7.36, "e": 7.62}, {"w": " it", "s": 7.62, "e": 7.82}, {"w": " in", "s": 7.82, "e": 7.96}, {"w": " the", "s": 7.96, "e": 8.08}, {"w": " refrigerator.", "s": 8.08, "e": 9.12}, {"w": " When", "s": 9.26, "e": 9.4}, {"w": " it's", "s": 9.4, "e": 9.56}, {"w": " time", "s": 9.56, "e": 9.88}, {"w": " for", "s": 9.88, "e": 10.06}, {"w": " supper,", "s": 10.06, "e": 10.88}, {"w": " warm", "s": 10.88, "e": 11.04}, {"w": " it", "s": 11.04, "e": 11.2}, {"w": " gently,", "s": 11.2, "e": 12.1}, {"w": " stir", "s": 12.1, "e": 12.2}, {"w": " in", "s": 12.2, "e": 12.4}, {"w": " the", "s": 12.4, "e": 12.52}, {"w": " milk,", "s": 12.52, "e": 13.16}, {"w": " and", "s": 13.16, "e": 13.26}, {"w": " it's", "s": 13.26, "e": 13.46}, {"w": " ready", "s": 13.46, "e": 13.76}, {"w": " in", "s": 13.